  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Power_Bracelets/BH_EPB_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1365\" height=\"439\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">透過這個全新模組，你可以製作各種手環來獲得特殊能力！目前仍在早期開發階段，我們計劃加入更多具有新功能的不同手環。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">現階段你可以使用力量手環、夜視、隱形、速度和緩降效果。盡情享受吧！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友一起遊玩的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Power_Bracelets/BH_EPB_promo.webp\" width=\"1365\" height=\"244\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果你正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>就是你的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」即可獲得25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Power_Bracelets/BH_EPB_summary.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1365\" height=\"146\">現在只要將這些神奇手環拿在手中，就能獲得永續藥水效果！目前我們已加入五種特效，後續還會持續增加更多...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Power_Bracelets/BH_EPB_faq.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1365\" height=\"146\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支援伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！記得與朋友玩模組的最佳方式就是使用BisectHosting，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結可享25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個模組可以加入模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布在Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，絕對不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果你考慮將本模組加入你的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們會非常感謝。如需任何調整或有疑問，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以錄製模組影片上傳到我的頻道嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！歡迎在你的頻道遊玩本模組或我們的任何模組包並製作影片，我們會非常感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Power_Bracelets/BH_EPB_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1365\" height=\"146\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/909/953/epic-power-bracelets.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"768\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/909/956/epic-power-bracelets-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1365\" height=\"768\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
